The fitness industry should shake off its trust crisis - China News Service
Another large fitness center "defaulted"?
Recently, the issue of fitness club members' rights protection has attracted public attention due to the well-known fitness institution Zhenjian Fitness.
After the Spring Festival, many members found that their store was not operating normally, and subsequently, rumors about the collapse of the runway caused panic among members, leading to the intervention of public security and the human resources and social services department.
Finally, an official from the concerned body came forward to respond and promised that it would do its utmost to safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of employees and members. This was what brought about the end of the storm.
Some fitness institutions temporarily closed their part-time stores due to operational problems. Why did some members think that "something was wrong" when they could wait for the problem to be solved?
Behind the fitness club membership dispute is an underlying issue of industry trust crisis.
Traditional gyms in China are generally based on pre-payment, and “making money from users who don’t come” is the underlying logic behind their growth.
By acquiring cash flow through pre-sale of membership cards and opening new stores continuously, it appears to be cyclical but in fact is merely eating one’s seed corn, unable to establish a stable profit model.
Negative publicity about fitness centers and other industries is frequently circulating, severely undermining consumer confidence.
From a market perspective, gyms can certainly be considered a good business opportunity.
The fitness trackers industry has been up and down, but it has always been a hotbed for capital.
Many data show that the market is continuing to warm up, with the interest in areas such as cultural and physical consumption continuing to rise.
In terms of the fitness market, with the steady improvement of residents’ living standards, the healthy lifestyle concept has been deeply rooted in people’s hearts, and the fitness industry has a bright future.
The better the situation is, the more the industry needs to pay attention to the quality of development.
However, some institutions are overly optimistic about the fitness market after the recovery of consumption. They are just out of the crisis and are eager to expand their businesses by investing all the funds in building new stores.
Undoubtedly, over the past few years due to the impact of the epidemic, many institutions have withdrawn from the market, and industry restructuring has occurred. Strong enterprises at this time choosing to increase their acquisition efforts and reposition themselves is not necessarily a missed opportunity.
But if the fitness market is to enter a virtuous cycle and move on a steady and long-term avenue of health, the industry must change its traditional model and change its business strategy.
Only by taking a firm approach and rebuilding consumer confidence and security can we truly win the market and win the future.
Rather than building new stores to capture market share, the fitness industry needs to focus on improving service quality and achieving sustainable growth to stabilize users.
First, it is necessary to rely on service to retain users.
Gyms are part of the service industry, its essence is to adhere to "user-oriented", to closely around the user's needs, focusing on the operation of the service quality upgrade.
Secondly, to improve user experience, it is necessary to rely on digital transformation.
For example, the Internet gym model, which is now popular, allows users to pay per session and choose their own venue.
At the same time, body data and movement data can be used effectively, and can also meet social needs, achieving a complete closed loop of services from online to offline.
Without private sales and large annual memberships, users’ concerns about gyms “running away” have been reduced, and their trust has also been improved.
In addition, we should actively explore diversified businesses.
Today, as sports consumption has moved from a single service to a scene, fitness clubs are expected to become new entry points to consumption, and peripheral products such as sports supplies and fitness equipment may become new profitable outlets, offering consumers a richer choice.
Jiang Tianxiang
Buy it for the difference!
Nanjing real estate market again shows "price compensation" - China News
Yangzi Evening News (reporter Ma Chubo) reported on October 10 that the reporter found out that the “guaranteed price agreement” that had not been seen for more than ten years had returned to the Nanjing real estate market. A property developer in Nanjing claimed that the “difference compensation” in the property was more than the discounts of other properties before the delivery of the property, and the developer was willing to exchange the property and return the difference.
The "Guaranteed Value Agreement" conditions aren't few.
The building is called the Polyantsi Yuntai in the Jiangbei New District, and the housekeeper, Mr. Sun, told reporters that he had found a “statement” while looking at the building last weekend.
The developer of the building has committed to exchange the property and refund the difference to the buyer of the property if the discount on the other property in the project is greater than the discount on the previous purchase (limited to other unsold property of the same type, building, unit, property type as the property) for those who purchased the property between 1 February and 28 February, from the date of signing the contract of sale between the parties and the delivery of the corresponding property.
Mr. Sun said that the sales consultant said that this was actually a "price protection agreement", which was to make buyers feel at ease, not to worry that the developer would reduce the price to promote sales, "now I'm afraid that after I buy it, it will be reduced in price, so I don't want to go to the sales office to make trouble, but I don't want to be sad if I don't make trouble."
There are still many homebuyers who believe that “price guarantee agreements,” while reassuring buyers with their assurances, come at a high price.
Ms. Chung, who is planning to buy a short-term home in Jiangbei, said that the housing stock for the guaranteed price is first of all the same type of home, and also in the same building, the same unit, and the buyer can compare the few housing stock, so the "threshold" is still quite high.
There are also buyers who believe that because of information asymmetry, salespeople may offer additional concessions without disclosing them to customers, making it difficult for buyers to seek redress.
Is it possible to retain home buyers remains to be seen.
The reporter in Nanjing online real estate inquiry, the building in November last year, the head of two buildings of a total of 252 units of housing source of sale permit, the area of the house is 105 square meters, 114 square meters, 129 square meters, etc., all the furniture sale permit average price of 39,843 yuan / sq.
However, more than two months later, online real estate shows that the total number of unsold units in the building is currently 157, representing 62.3 per cent, of which 128 units in Building 8, representing 113 unsold units, and 44 units in Building 7, representing 124 unsold units, and the total number of deals in the project is only 33, representing only 13 per cent.
Market sources have reported that “price guarantee agreements” have also appeared in Nanjing in 2008.
In August of that year, the building on Huangshan Road, Hebei, Yongkang West Yard to attract the attention of buyers, introduced the Guaranteed Price Plan, the specific content of which is "the company solemnly promises that if the project's concessions are expanded within a year, the resulting difference, the company will refund the difference to the old owner."
In April 2011, nine residential properties in Nanjing also promised to compensate the difference in price.
“The property market is warming up, and it needs a ‘strong heart’ at this time.
Senior real estate developer Shen Mr., who is an expert in property development, said that “price protection agreements” are also one of the marketing methods used by developers.
He argues that developers need confidence more than buyers do, and that the introduction of “price guarantee agreements” is actually encouraging them.
As to whether buyers would be retained, he said that this depended on the impact of multiple factors, such as regulatory policies and loan thresholds, which remained to be seen at present.
Chinese rescue team continues rescue operations in Turkey, rescuing 4 people trapped - China News Service
On February 10, the Chinese rescue team sent three operating teams and 45 rescue personnel to rescue a trapped person who was searching for a rescue in Turkey, according to the Ministry of Emergency Management website.
At the same time, two search assessment teams were deployed to carry out an assessment and survey of 15 buildings on Vodabash Street.
To date, four trapped persons have been rescued, five victims have been searched and life signs and risk assessments have been conducted in 25 buildings that have collapsed severely.
The rescue teams will adjust their rescue forces scientifically according to the actual situation in the disaster area and the rescue site, and will carry out continuous and in-depth rescue work.
The rescue team obtained information about the requests for assistance through embassies, local governments, United Nations relief organizations and other sources, and verified each case by means of online inquiries and on-site searches.
Introduce the current rescue environment and building collapse to the Chinese Hong Kong Rescue Team, and jointly carry out search operations.
The United Nations is currently jointly responsible for regional coordination with the Italian Rescue Team (SSC5). At the same time, three team members are participating in the work of the Regional Rescue Coordination Centre No. 5, communicating with many teams, including those from Italy, the United Kingdom, Serbia, Slovakia and Oman, and learning about the situation of the United Nations Rescue Organization and the national rescue teams.
The rescue team continued to strengthen safety management and team support, and implemented the principle of "unified command and safety first" to strengthen the safety control of the rescue site, strengthen the discipline requirements of rescue work, and clearly the safety reminders.
We will continue to implement the rotation standby and guard post work system and strengthen the security management of the camp.
The medical staff of the rescue team provides medical examination services to the team members on a daily basis, and strengthens the medical protection of the priority personnel. All the rescue team members are now in good health and are carrying out the elimination of the camp area.
After establishing their own campsite, the logistics support team has set up 4 major categories of tents – command communication, equipment storage, medical decontamination, living accommodation, and dog kennels – totaling 26 tents to ensure that more than 30 sets of on-site rescue equipment were available for use.
Kim Jong-nam and his daughter have close father-daughter interactions, but his wife is left out in the cold.
（Combined report, September 11th） North Korea held a military parade on the 75th anniversary of the founding of the army on the evening of the 8th day of the month. The leader Kim Jong-un's daughter, Kim Yo-jong, not only attended the parade, but also stood on the podium with her father.
On the 9th day of the month, the Korean Central News Agency released a video showing Kim Jong-un hugging his father and talking to him in a low voice. She often looked at him with a loving gaze and touched his chest. The father-daughter interaction was broadcast throughout the country.
But the first lady, Li Xue, had to take a back seat.
According to reports from “Korean Central News Agency” and others, Kim Jong-nam and Ri Sol-ju were seen at an official photo of their daughter Kim Jung-a attending a banquet on July 7th. Kim Jung-a was not only rarely sitting in the middle C position with her parents but also joined Kim Jong-nam together with him on the podium for the military parade celebrating the 75th anniversary of建军节.
The “North Korean Central Television” (KCTV) released footage of the parade after the fact, revealing more scenes of father-son affection.
Kim Jong-un and his daughter looked at each other several times from the podium, and their smiles never left their faces. They also whispered to each other in their ears, and Kim Jong-un once held his father's cheeks with both hands, and Kim Jong-un also smiled back.
Other official media footage shows Kim Jong-un and Kim Jong-il sitting on a sofa in the room, with Kim’s hands touching her father’s face; and walking with her father, with her hands touching Kim’s chest.
And First Lady Li Xuezhong was always trailing behind or sitting to one side, never closer than a few steps from her husband and daughter.
According to Korean media, since the first time he appeared in public after the launch of the first 17-rocket missile on November 18 last year, the exposure probability of Kim Jong-un has been increasing, and he has appeared five times in official occasions.
The official media used the highest titles of dearest son and honourable son when referring to Kim Jong-il, and broadcast a scene in which Kim Jong-il repeatedly shouted his death oath to the Whitehead bloodline while standing in the stands overlooking the parade.
These signs have raised doubts about whether Kim Jong-un has been predetermined as the heir to the Kim dynasty, and the Washington Post analysis said "this is a signal that Kim Jong-un is pushing his daughter to the position of the next leader at a young age." However, some opinions believe that it is too early to make such judgments, as there are various possibilities in the situation where Kim Jong-un has a son.
Xinhua Commentator: Promoting China’s Modernization is a Systematic Project – Four Commentaries on Deeply Understanding the Keynote Address of General Secretary Xi Jinping at the Opening Ceremony of the Study Session on Learning and Implementing the Spirit of the 20th CPC National Congress - China News Service
Xinhua News Agency, Beijing, February 11 (Zhang Ying) - The article is entitled: Promoting the Chinese Modernization is a Systematic Work - Four Thoughts on Deeply Understanding the Important Speech of General Secretary Xi Jinping at the Opening Ceremony of the Study Session on Learning and Implementing the Spirit of the 20th CPC National Congress
Xinhua News Agency commentator
“Promoting Chinese-style modernization is a systemic project that requires comprehensive consideration, systematic planning and overall advancement, and the correct handling of a series of important relationships, such as top-level design and practical exploration, strategy and tactics, integrity and innovation, efficiency and equity, dynamism and order, self-reliance and openness to the outside world.
At the opening ceremony of the seminar on the twentieth anniversary of the Party and the implementation of Xi Jinping's socialist ideas with Chinese characteristics in the new era, held for members, deputy members and key leadership cadres at the provincial and ministerial levels of the New Progressive Party Central Committee, General Secretary Xi Jinping scientifically grasped the principles of modernization construction, systematically and in depth clarified a series of important relationships that need to be addressed in practice, and provided scientific methodology for us to vigorously advance Chinese-style modernization.
The promotion of Chinese-style modernization involves all areas of economic, political, cultural, social and ecological civilization, and is related to all aspects of the governing party, the governing state, the governing army, domestic affairs, foreign affairs, defence and so on. We must have a good system of planning and be courageous to innovate reforms and to continue to achieve overall progress.
To design an overarching strategy requires deep insight into the world’s development trends and accurate grasp of the common aspirations of the people. It also involves in-depth exploration of economic and social development laws to ensure that the planning and policy system reflects its timeliness, adheres to laws, and is innovative. The plan should be coherent both far and near, harmonize top-down with bottom-up, and coordinate content.
Promoting modernization in the Chinese style is an exploratory endeavour, and there are many unknown areas that need to be boldly explored in practice. We must not be afraid to take the risk and take the risk to advance our business by reforming and innovating.
A strategic issue is a fundamental problem for a party and a country.
To advance the Chinese-style modernization, we must strengthen the forward-looking nature of the strategy, anticipate the future and lead it with scientific strategies; strengthen the comprehensive nature of the strategy, focus on solving the major problems that affect the rise and fall of the Party and the nation &apos; s cause and move the whole body at once; and strengthen the stability of the strategy. Once the strategy has been formulated, it must be adhered to for a long time, taken to its full extent and well-done.
We must grasp the dialectical unity between strategy and tactics, and unite the principles of strategy and the flexibility of tactics, and be flexible and adaptable, make decisions on the spot, and grasp the strategic initiative in the process of adapting to the situation, fitting the situation, and responding to the situation.
The Chinese nation is a nation of upholding the right and innovation.
Handle the relationship between upholding and innovating well, while firmly adhering to the distinctive features of China’s modernization path, essential requirements, and major principles of socialism with Chinese characteristics, ensuring that China’s modernization proceeds on the right track; at the same time, placing innovation in an important position within the overall development of the country, responding to the demands of the times, focusing on addressing significant theoretical and practical issues, actively adapting to changes, responding to challenges, and promoting reform and innovation, continuously shaping new momentum for economic growth and enhancing national strength through innovation-driven development.
Efficiency is an important foundation for fairness, and fairness is a powerful guarantee for efficiency.
We are pursuing the Chinese-style modernization, which aims to create greater efficiency than capitalism, while at the same time more effectively preserving social equity, and better achieving the balance, promotion and unification of efficiency and equity.
We will deal with the relationship between efficiency and equity, and will continue to achieve development for the people, development dependent on the people, and development results shared by the people, so that the results of modernization and construction benefit all people more and more equitably.
To advance China’s modernization model, it is necessary to handle the relationship between vitality and order, ensuring that society remains both dynamic and orderly.
We must integrate development and security, implement the overall national security concept, strengthen the national security system, enhance the capacity to maintain national security and firmly uphold the security of the national regime, the security of the system, the security of the ideology and the security of the priority areas.
China has taken greater account of security aspects in its development, enhanced national security through development and used development achievements to strengthen the basis of national security. It has also been able to create a security environment conducive to economic and social development, continuously stimulating development dynamism and achieving a positive interaction between high-quality development and a high level of security.
To advance China’s modernization model, we must both adhere to our own path and broaden our world perspective; we should also uphold openness to the outside world, continuously expanding the breadth and depth of China’s modernization model.
We must adhere to independent self-reliance, self-reliance, and strengthen the position of the country and the nation in our own strength, and firmly grasp the destiny of the development and progress of our country in our own hands.
We must continuously expand the high level of openness to the outside world, participate in depth in the global division of labour and industrial cooperation, make good use of domestic and international resources, expand the space for China-style modernization, share development opportunities in a win-win environment and jointly create a better future.
Follow the path to achieve far-reaching goals.
Under the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee, with Comrade Xi Jinping as its core, and under the scientific guidance of Xi Jinping &apos; s socialist ideas with Chinese characteristics for the new era, let us grasp the rules, act with perseverance, fully use our energy, initiative and creativity, correctly deal with a series of important relations, strive to achieve the new goal of comprehensive construction of a socialist modernized country, and continuously open up new territory for modernization in the Chinese style.
Together to resist the CPC, the US, Japan and the Philippines reached a consensus on defense
Asia - On February 9, Philippine President Bongbong Marcos visited Japan and met with Prime Minister Fumio Kishida.
The two sides reached a consensus on opposing the Chinese Communist Party &apos; s violations of the South and East Seas, and the Fiji-Japanese leaders issued a joint statement after the meeting, stating that they would carry out substantive defence exchanges by signing a trilateral defence agreement with the United States and opposing the Chinese Communist Party &apos; s hegemony policy.
According to Japanese media, Fumio Kishida hopes to use this meeting to help Japan and the Philippines establish a policy on the Taiwan Strait crisis.
Marcos of Malaca visited China in early January and signed an agreement worth $20 billion.
But relations with China have not improved but rather deteriorated since then.
Earlier this month, the Philippines signed an agreement with the United States to open more bases to US troops to ensure security in the South China Sea.
The new base is located 300 km from Taiwan, which is the closest location to China.
If there is a crisis in Taiwan, US forces may launch operations from bases in the Philippines.
The Japanese media now believes that Japan, Korea, Taiwan, and even the Philippines are forming an axis with the US, building a “confrontational arc against the CCP” in the Western Pacific to promote regional cooperation.
China encourages higher fertility rate to encourage sperm donation to universities high quality standards
The China Human Sperm Bank in Yunnan Province has launched an advertisement to solicit donors with bachelor's degrees or higher education or students currently enrolled, offering a subsidy of RMB 4,500 for successful donations totaling eight to twelve cycles.
According to today’s reports in the Taiwanese media, the message was searched for on Weibo that day, and prompted follow-up initiatives in many provinces and cities, including Zhejiang, Shaanxi, Hubei, Shandong, and Beijing.
According to a report by the Free Times, China encourages university students to donate sperm.
The donor requirements for different universities are different. The donor requirements for Beijing University are the highest. In addition to the academic requirements, the donor must be taller than 1.70 meters, have a good appearance, no obvious hair loss, and the near vision degree cannot be higher than 600 degrees.
According to the report, the Yunnan Human Sperm Bank stated that sperm donors can receive a complete set of men's health tests worth 1,000 yuan, "especially sperm and chromosome tests, which most people have never done, and are important for understanding their fertility status."
Donors must meet the following criteria: height over 165 cm, bachelor's degree or higher education level (or currently enrolled), no color blindness or color weakness, and no genetic diseases such as hepatitis B.
The report quotes a message from China’s Tianmu News that says there is an advertisement in the sperm bank of Shaanxi province which reads “donating sperm for money and infinite glory.” It calls on young people to donate their sperm and encourages netizens to forward related information so as to spread love.
The price in Shaanxi Province is higher than that in Yunnan Province. Qualified donors can receive RMB300 in cash each time, and those who have completed a certain number of donations can receive RMB5000.
The highest known price is in Beijing, where the maximum subsidized price is RMB 5,150.
"Funds E-account" is coming: the Securities and Exchange Commission authorized to develop all funds under the name of investors achieves aggregation and query - Economic Observation Network - Professional financial news website
Economic Observer reporter Chen Meng: The purchase channel of funds is complicated, which makes it difficult to collect account information.
Always forgetting "the little gold piggy bank"?
These problems of the Ki-inhabitants are about to be resolved.
On February 10, the CSRC announced that the "fund E account" APP was launched for public trial operation in various mobile application stores.
According to the introduction, the "Fund E Account" provides a "one-stop" query service for individual investors to obtain information on public fund accounts and shares, and is aimed at solving the pain points of forgetting accounts and querying in the industry.
According to Wind data, as of the end of 2022, there were 156 public fund management companies in China, with a total of about 26 trillion yuan in fund management; 167 fund registration agencies and 411 fund sales agencies.
The accounting system of each registration institution is independent of each other, and there is no unified query channel in the industry.
Industry insiders said that at the end of 2021, there were more than 720 million fund investors in China, which means that half of the country's population invested in fund products.
Previously, investors had to search for purchases through different sales agencies, but with the “fund E account” they can search for purchases through all sales channels, and have a clear view of the fund holdings.
What is the "Fund E Account" APP?
According to the relevant documents, the "Fund E Account" APP is a mobile application developed and built by China Clearing Co., Ltd. with the approval of the China Securities Regulatory Commission. It can provide one-stop query of the holdings of off-exchange public fund products for investors.
Investors can conveniently and quickly grasp the holdings of all fund products of all fund managers through the "Fund E account", which is a new channel for investors to check their holdings of fund products through all sales channels. This will greatly improve the query efficiency.
Specifically, investors can query information about their fund accounts through the “Fund E Account,” including account information for funds opened at all public mutual fund managers and trading accounts opened at public fund sales institutions, as well as holdings of products such as open-end securities investment funds and collective asset management plans that do not have an upper limit on the number of investors.
Liu Yicheng, the business manager of Shanghai Securities Fund Evaluation Research Center, told the Economic Observer that investors can get to know their holdings of off-exchange public fund through the "Fund E Account" App, which can help them find "lost assets", and more importantly, it can help customers to collect comprehensive information of their fund investment in a unified account, which can help customers to better and more timely, accurate and complete grasp their own investment situation, and better optimize their fund portfolio, and better plan their own financial arrangements.
How to register and use?
Reporters noticed that the "Fund E Account" APP has been listed in the app stores of Huawei, Apple, Xiaomi, OPPO, and vivo, but the APP is still in the trial operation stage. Investors can register by filling in the invitation code and can contact the fund management company that holds the fund to obtain the invitation code.
A customer service representative of a large public fund in Shanghai provided a 6-digit invitation code to the Economic Observer reporter and told the reporter, "During the trial operation of the APP, China Clearing provided a certain number of invitation codes to each fund management company. Investors can call to obtain them. We will provide them to investors.
After the trial run, no invitation code will be required for open user registration.
Translation requested.
The journalists according to the official website of the Securities and Exchange Commission published "fund E account" download and use instructions related documents to register the account and complete the query, the whole process takes only a few minutes, mainly divided into four steps: user registration, real name authentication, fund account binding, public fund query.
After verifying the identity, click the "Assets" button to bind the fund, and all the funds purchased through various fund sales platforms will be displayed in the list of binding options (can be bound to the account). After binding, you can see the total assets of the fund and can start using the query function.
It is worth noting that the "Fund E Account" only provides query services to investors, and cannot conduct redemption and repurchase.
The data displayed in the "Fund E account" is generally the date of the user's query (T day) forwarded by three trading days.
For example, on February 10, open the "Fund E account" and the total assets, fund shares, and net asset value of the corresponding date will be displayed as the date three days before, i.e., February 7.
