Strongly recommend Amazon to stop using EMS!
The goods are five stars, the logistics is one star, the average is three stars.
Why Amazon would send EMS? It’s not credible, right? After all, computers are also valuable items!
The order was placed after the purchase, and it was estimated to be delivered on the 20th. The family waited at home for three days!
Why does it take four or five days to send it from Xiamen to Fuzhou?
On Tuesday morning, I finally checked my logistics and found out that it arrived in Fuzhou. I was so excited to open and receive it! However, when I went to check the logistics again at night, there were no calls or messages from anyone. To my surprise, the package had already been signed for by someone else in the afternoon!
I was shocked at once!
Who am I? Where am I? Is this computer really mine?
Isn't it just to doubt life?
Finally, I brought the computer back after running errands at a drop-off point.
The specific reason is simple, because the express delivery guy mixed up the two numbers, but fortunately, the package was not lost.
I strongly recommend that Amazon stop using EMS, and I will not buy anything from Amazon in the future if it sends it by EMS.
